# Xorg driver for the X11 desktops (Xfce, LXQt, MATE, Sxmo):
# auto | opentegra | modesetting. opentegra = Tegra 2 GPU (2D + 3D EXA).
# Images built with the opentegra driver ship "auto"; modesetting is the fallback.
# auto = try Tegra 2D acceleration, fall back to modesetting if X fails twice.
# Change with: nuraxoom-display <mode>
modesetting
